            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"design-patterns\">Design patterns</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"design-patterns-are-typical-solutions-to-recurring-problems-in-software-design-each-pattern-is-a-blueprint-you-can-adapt-to-solve-a-particular-design-problem-in-your-code\">Design patterns are typical solutions to recurring problems in software design. Each pattern is a blueprint you can adapt to solve a particular design problem in your code.</h3>\n</blockquote>\n<p align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IGFC6oFmL._SL1500_.jpg\" alt=\"Design Patterns book cover\" width=\"400\"/>\n\n</span></span>"
