          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"anti-patterns-in-python\">Anti-patterns in Python</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Python is a flexible language that allows us to achieve our programming goals in many different ways</li>\n<li>This flexibility can be a double-edged sword</li>\n<li>According to the Zen of Python, there should only be one obvious way to fix a problem</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Kclp",
      "code_hash": "62c419403810be24fd7d161233ea23e2",
      "outputs": [
