          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"how-do-we-avoid-anti-patterns-in-python\">How do we avoid anti-patterns in Python?</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Use a static code analysis tools ()</li>\n<li>Be aware of common mistakes</li>\n<li>Improve your general programming knowledge (data structures, algorithms, principles, patterns)</li>\n<li>Learn more about your modules - either built-in or external</li>\n<li>Ask an expert (or use an LLM) to review your code</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
