            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><style>\npre {\n    background-color: #1e1e1e !important;\n    color: #d4d4d4 !important;\n    padding: 12px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n}\n</style>\n<h1 id=\"setting-up-an-automated-linter\">Setting up an automated linter</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Step 1: Install pre-commit\n<div class=\"language-bash codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>pip<span class=\"w\"> </span>install<span class=\"w\"> </span>pre-commit\n</code></pre></div>\nStep 2: Create .pre-commit-config.yaml\n<div class=\"language-bash codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>repos:\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>-<span class=\"w\"> </span>repo:<span class=\"w\"> </span>https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff-pre-commit\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>rev:<span class=\"w\"> </span>v0.5.0\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>hooks:\n\n<span class=\"w\">            </span>-<span class=\"w\"> </span>id:<span class=\"w\"> </span>ruff\n\n<span class=\"w\">            </span>-<span class=\"w\"> </span>id:<span class=\"w\"> </span>ruff-format\n</code></pre></div>\nStep 3: Enable pre-commit\n<div class=\"language-bash codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>pre-commit<span class=\"w\"> </span>install\n</code></pre></div></span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
